<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gold Fields Props H1 shr up, div off.</title>
<headline>Gold Fields Props H1 shr up, div off.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     43	   vs    40</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 25	   vs    40</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	4.40	 vs    4.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   7.02	 vs    6.78</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.62	 vs    2.73</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.02	 vs    0.08</p>
<p>    Revenue		   9.35	 vs    9.19</p>
<p>Div payable Feb 26</p>
<p>on register Feb 7</p>
<p>Full name: Gold Fields Property Company Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said earnings in the second half of the year were expected to be at least maintained at the level achieved in the six months to December 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
